о засчитается. \n","type":"text"},{"type":"mapPointLink","href":"/map/:mode/customs?q=gazel","pointId":"gazel","mapName":"Таможня","mapNormalizedName":"customs","description":"Найти транспорт с реагентом на локации Таможня"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"content":"Внимание"},{"content":[{"content":"После выполнения квеста, данные о местонахождение транспорта с реагентом можно сдать одному из 3-х торговцев на выбор. Выбрав кого-то одного, вы получаете определённую награду от торговца, теряя возможность сдать квест двум другим:\n","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":"[","type":"text"},{"content":"","href":"https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.comhttps://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fescapefromtarkov.fandom.com%2Fru%2Fwiki%2F%25D0%2591%25D0%25BE%25D0%25BB%25D1%258C%25D1%2588%25D0%25BE%25D0%25B9_%25D0%25B7%25D0%25B0%25D0%25BA%25D0%25B0%25D0%25B7%25D1%2587%25D0%25B8%25D0%25BA%3Faction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&uselang=ru&metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section","title":"Sign in to edit","type":"link"},{"content":"]","type":"text"},{"type":"table","rows":[{"type":"tableRow","cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"content":"Прапор","href":"https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/ru/wiki/%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80","title":"Прапор","type":"link"}],"isHeader":true},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"content":"Терапевт","href":"https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/ru/wiki/%D0%A2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%B2%D1%82","title":"Терапевт","type":"link"}],"isHeader":true},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"content":"Лыжник","href":"https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/ru/wiki/%D0%9B%D1%8B%D0%B6%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA","title":"Лыжник","type":"link"}],"isHeader":true}]},{"type":"tableRow","cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"content":"Большой заказчик","type":"text"}],"isHeader":true},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"content":"Простое любопытство","href":"/quest/:mode/out-of-curiosity","title":"Простое любопытство","type":"link